  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Facility &#xBF;Digital, Science, Technology and Innovation, Space</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &#xBF;Technical&amp;nbsp;Assistance Facility(TAF)&amp;nbsp;Digital/Science, Technology&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Innovation/Space&#xBF;&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;support the European Union(EU) services&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;implementation&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;of Directorate-General&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;International Partnerships &#xBF;&amp;nbsp;(DG&amp;nbsp;INTPA) projects/initiatives/programmes&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;fieldsof&amp;nbsp;Digital&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;Development(D4D)andScience, Technology and Innovation, and Space Technologies &amp; Earth Observation. The&amp;nbsp;geographic&amp;nbsp;scope&amp;nbsp;is: African,&amp;nbsp;Caribbean&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Pacific&amp;nbsp;(ACP)&amp;nbsp;group&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;states&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Overseas&amp;nbsp;Countries&amp;nbsp;and Territories (OCT).Priority countries1will reflect DG INTPA(D4D&amp;nbsp;Hub2), DG&amp;nbsp;CNECTandDG&amp;nbsp;DEFIS3priority countries but will be flexible to respond to demands.The services will be provided in particular to the headquarters of the European Commission, and to a limited extent to otherkey stakeholderssuch as JRC, the EEAS4and EU member states.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
